.next/
out/
build/
dist/
.parcel-cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel/
.turbo/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. 业务状态与持久化数据 (Project Specific States) - 【🚨 针对 TruthDecoder 优化】
